{"timestamp":"2026-09-01T11:03:18.818Z","ordinal":1318,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a05ca3-4422-7bc3-acb0-c038ab903cc4","call_id":"call_NzbMQGEybUif1VdddVTBBEt9","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 2.6 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"\"Historical Ryokan Hostel K's House Ito Onsen：access (https://kshouse.jp/ito-e/access.html)\\nciteturn9search0 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last week; K's House Ito Onsen is next to Tokaikan.\\n# Access|K's House Ito Onsen\\n\\nJapanese | English\\n\\n\\n### Access\\n\\niframe\\n\\nTraditional Ryokan Hostel K’s House -Ito Onsen-  12-13 Higashimatsubaracho, Ito\\n\\nImage: How to get to K's House from JR Ito Station\\n\\n1. After leaving JR Ito station pass the rotary and go straight along Icho-dori street. (Turn at the tourist information office in front of JR Ito station).\\n\\n2. Continue downhill for 5-6 minutes (500m), turn left at the intersection before the bridge and take the narrow street on the right hand side (Matsukawa-dori street).\\n\\n3. After about 50m you will see Tokaikan on your right hand side. K's House Ito Onsen is next to Tokaikan.\\n\\n \\n\\nView on Google Maps\\n\\n### Access Guide\\n\\nImage: 電車乗り換えガイド Image: 電車乗り換えガイド\\n\\nTravel time and fares are approximate, they will vary depending on seat type and other factors--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\\nBooking Form - K's House Ito Onsen in Izu peninsula, Shizuoka (https://kshouse.jp/ito-e-form/booking/)\\nciteturn9search1 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 7.5 years ago; Booking Form - K's House Ito Onsen ... ( If you have it in Japan.)\\nImage: Booking Form\\nBooking Form - K's House Ito Onsen\\n \\n[Input]\\nGuest Information Fields marked with an asterisk(*) are required\\nName* 　　　　　　　　　 First name\\n[Input] Last name\\n[Input]\\nNationality [Input]\\nOccupation [Input]\\nMobile Phone Number\\n( If you have it in Japan.) [Input]\\nEmail Address* [Input]\\nRe-type Email* [Input]\\n \\nBooking Information\\n10% discount will be applied by booking 3 or more consecutive nights !\\nCheck-in Date* [Select]Image [Select]\\nCheck-out Date* [Select]Image [Select]\\nNumber of Night* [Select]\\nNumber of Guest* [Select]\\nMale [Select]ImageAge [Select]\\nFemale [Select]ImageAge [Select]\\nChildren [Select]ImageAge [Select]Image [Select]Image [Select]\\nType of Room  \\nFirst Choice* [Select]\\nSecond Choice [Select]\\nThird Choice [Select]\\nEstimated Arrival Time [Select]\\nCredit Card Information\\nA credit card is required to confirm/guarantee your reservation.\\nWe do not take any deposit and payment in advance.\\nYour credit card information will be protected by SSL.\\nCredit Card Type* [Select]\\nCard Holder Name* [Input]\\nas it appears on the card\\nCredit Card Number* [Input] - [Input] - [Input] - [Input]\\ne.g. 1234-5678-9012-2345\\nExpiration Date* [Select]Image [Select]\\n  [Input] Please check the box to show that you have understood the cancellation policy.\\n \\n[Input] Please check the box to show that you have understood the booking is NOT confirmed yet.\\n   \\nComments\\n[Input]\\n \\n[Input] [Input] [Input] [Input] [Input] [Input]--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\\n伊豆の有形文化財旅館ホステル｜ケイズハウス伊東温泉 (https://kshouse.jp/ito-j/index.html)\\nciteturn9search2 [wordlim: 200] Published: 2.7 years ago; Crawled: 4 days ago; ### About K's House Ito Onsen\\n# テレワーク・リモートワーク推奨の宿！広々ラウンジで快適Wifiアクセス\\n\\nJapanese | English\\n\\n\\n### About K's House Ito Onsen\\n\\nImage\\n\\n伊豆・伊東温泉の築100年の文化財旅館が外国人向けホステルとして生まれ変わり、14周年を迎えました。\\n日本で唯一、国の登録有形文化財で源泉掛け流しの純和風ホステルです。\\n毎分100リットルを超える100％自家源泉かけ流しの温泉は弱アルカリ性のナトリウム・カルシウム塩化物泉。\\n\\n日帰り温泉は朝8時から夜8時までご利用可能です。（清掃時間11:00～15:00を除く）\\n\\nテレワーク・リモートワークに最適なラウンジでは高速Wifi完備・延長コード無料貸し出し・携帯充電器の無料貸し出しなどがご利用いただけます。\\nケイズハウス伊東温泉紹介動画はこちら\\n\\n### Movie\\n\\nYouTube video player\\n\\n### Access\\nImage  | 源泉掛け流しの温泉\\nImage  | 国指定有形文化財の建物\\nImage  | 門限なし\\n\\n\\n### News\\n\\n  * News\\n  * Topics\\n\\n  * 2024.01.06\\nnoteにてケイズハウス伊東温泉の魅力が紹介されました!!\\n  * 2023.09.15\\nホステルスタッフ募集中です！\\n\\nMORE\\n\\n  * 2024.01.06\\n支配人・岩村幸雄さんに聞く、ケイズハウス伊東温泉の魅力\\n\\nMORE\\n\\n### Recruit\\n\\nImage: 画像\\n\\n世界各国からのゲストと交流したい方、日本にいながら外国にいるように思える環境で働いてみませんか。宿の運営全般に携わることができるやりがいのある仕事内容です。\\n\\nMORE\\n\\n# Traditional Ryokan Hostel K’s House Ito Onsen\\n\\nA listed 100-year-old traditional Japanese Onsen Ryokan had turned into a budget hostel in 2010. Visitors can enjoy 100% pure hot spring spa (Onsen) at reasonable price within few hours from Tokyo. We speak:\\n\\n  * English\\n\\nHigashimatsubaracho 12-13 414-0022 Ito Izu Peninsula, Japan\\n\\nPhone: +81 557 35 9444 Image: Entrance of the hostel Room rates: 2950yen – 7800yen per person--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\\nReservation | Find the Best Rates at Hostel K's House Ito Onsen official HP (https://kshouse.jp/ito-e/bookings13_e/index.html)\\nciteturn9search3 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 4 days ago; # Reservations | K's House Ito Onsen | Book your bed now!\\n# Reservations | K's House Ito Onsen | Book your bed now!\\n\\nJapanese | English\\n\\n  *   *   *   *   *   * Image\\n\\nJPEN\\n\\nView on Google Maps\\n\\n×\\n\\nImage\\n\\nReservations\\n\\n  * Room Availability\\n\\n### Reservations\\n\\nReservations can be made online.\\n\\nWe require your credit card information to guarantee your reservation.Image: クレジットカード\\n\\nPlease read our FAQ before you make your reservation.\\n\\nImportant message. Please read carefully before booking.\\nOur hostel is registered as a cultural heritage property, therefore we ask you to treat our facilities with great care and appreciation.\\nAs our building is quite an old we apologize for any inconvenience caused by squeaking floorboards or voices from neighboring rooms.\\nOur hostel is primarily for individual travellers. For that reason, we may not be able to accommodate a group of 10 people or more.\\nOur dormitories have age restrictions. We are unable to accommodate guests under the age of 16 in our dormitory rooms.\\nK's House Ito Onsen is a NON-SMOKING property. This policy is strictly enforced.\\n\\n  * All rates are per person per night and include consumption tax.\\n  * City tax JPY300 per person per night will be added onto roomrates.\\n  * Linens are included in room rates.\\n  * Children 0 to 6 years old stay free of charge when sharing beds with parents.\\n  * To guarantee your reservation, VISA or MasterCard credit cards are necessary. \\n  * Reception hours 8:00～20:30.\\n  * Guests aged under 16 are not able to stay in dormitory rooms.\\n  * Check-in time is 15:00～20:30, Check-out time is 11:00.\\n  * Rooms do not have TVs installed. Please enjoy the relaxing traditional atmosphere of our historical building.\\n\\n#### Online Reservations - オンライン予約\\n\\nYou will receive a confirmation e-mail after submitting your reservation.\\nIf you do not receive a confirmation e-mail you may have entered your e-mail address incorrectly.\\nIn this case please send email to ito@kshouse.jp.\\nIn case your credit card is not verified, your confirmation will automatically be cancelled. \\n\\n \\n\\n#### Cancellation Policy\\n\\nWe require 72 hours notice of cancellation or any changes to your reservation prior to your scheduled arrival \\notherwise we will charge you a cancellation fee as below. \\n\\n* For reservations cancelled BEFORE 23:59 three days before the scheduled check-in date, there will be no cancellation charge.\\n* For reservations cancelled between 00:00 and 23:59 two days before the scheduled check-in date, the cancellation charge will be 30% of the fee for the first night.\\n* For reservations cancelled between 00:00 and 23:59 the day before the scheduled check-in date, the cancellation charge will be 50% of the fee for the first night.\\n* For reservations cancelled after 00:00am on the scheduled check-in date the cancellation charge will be 100% of the fee for the first night.\\n*In case where no notice of cancellation is received (no-show), guests will be charged 100% of the total booking. --------------------------------------------------------------------------------\\n公式｜最安値｜ケイズハウス伊東温泉のご予約 (https://kshouse.jp/ito-j/bookings13/index.html)\\nciteturn9search4 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last week; # Traditional Ryokan Hostel K’s House Ito Onsen\\n  * お部屋にはTVを設置しておりません。\\n\\n#### Online Reservations - オンライン予約\\n\\nご宿泊のご希望とお客様情報入力後、ご予約が確定となります。\\n予約完了の自動返信がない場合は、メールアドレスの入力間違いの可能性がございます。恐れ入りますが、メールにてお問い合わせください。\\n\\n\\n#### キャンセルについて\\n\\nご予約のキャンセルや変更の場合は、分かり次第ご連絡ください。\\nキャンセル料金は以下の通りご請求させていただきますのでご了承ください。\\n\\n  *     * チェックイン予定日３日前まで　 ------- キャンセル料金なし\\n    * チェックイン予定日の２日前まで ------- １泊目宿泊料金の３０％\\n    * チェックイン予定日の前日　　　 ------- １泊目宿泊料金の５０％\\n    * チェックイン予定日の当日　　　 ------- １泊目宿泊料金の１００%\\n    * 連絡なしの不泊　　　　　　　　 ------- 宿泊料金総額の１００%\\n  * ※2泊以上のご予約で初日の宿泊予定日を連絡なしで不泊の場合2泊目以降は自動的にキャンセルされます。\\n  * その場合においてもキャンセル料は宿泊料金総額が請求されます。キャンセルの際は必ずご連絡をお願いいたします。\\n\\nチェックイン後のキャンセルにつきましても、上記のとおりキャンセル料をご請求させていただきます。\\n\\n\\n# Traditional Ryokan Hostel K’s House Ito Onsen\\n\\nA listed 100-year-old traditional Japanese Onsen Ryokan had turned into a budget hostel in 2010. Visitors can enjoy 100% pure hot spring spa (Onsen) at reasonable price within few hours from Tokyo. We speak:\\n\\n  * English\\n\\nHigashimatsubaracho 12-13 414-0022 Ito Izu Peninsula, Japan\\n\\nPhone: +81 557 35 9444 Image: Entrance of the hostel Room rates: 2950yen – 7800yen per person--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\\nケイズハウス伊東温泉のご利用に関して｜ケイズハウス (https://kshouse.jp/ito-j/faq.html)\\nciteturn9search5 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last week; # Traditional Ryokan Hostel K’s House Ito OnsenA listed 100-year-old traditional Japanese Onsen Ryokan had turned into a budget hostel in 2010.\\nまた、カセットコンロ等の火器の使用も禁止させて頂きます。有形文化財の木造建築ですので、ご理解ください。\\n\\n  * シャンプー・リンスも持参する必要がありますか？\\n\\nシャンプー・ヘアーコンディショナー及びボディソープは備